        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Any product candidate we develop and commercialize will have to compete with existing therapies, as well as therapies currently in development or that may be developed in the future.",
        "start_character": 88973,
        "end_character": 89155
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our early product design efforts, we tested AAV9, which has clinically established safety profile and cardiac tropism and proven manufacturability, alongside several other capsids for tropism to cardiomyocytes and for resulting mRNA and protein expression, and in our hands AAV9 proved to be superior to other available capsids.",
        "start_character": 81559,
        "end_character": 81898
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During the term of the collaboration agreement, except in connection with the conduct of validation activities under the research plan, we are not permitted to conduct any research or development activities with respect to certain collaboration targets or any therapeutic products designed to be directed to such targets for as long as the target remains a collaboration target.",
        "start_character": 14286,
        "end_character": 14664
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For Tenaya, we believe these actions collectively reflect a commitment to facilitating the development and approval of cell and gene therapy products for rare conditions and balancing safety and rigorous standards with accelerating access to innovative medicines for patients.",
        "start_character": 22107,
        "end_character": 22383
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide a variety of programs and services to help employees meet and balance their needs at work, at home and in life, including healthcare, insurance and other benefit plans.",
        "start_character": 178510,
        "end_character": 178702
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Leveraging our extensive in-house capabilities, we are able to take a differentiated and competitively advantageous approach to target identification and validation and preclinical characterization of each of our prospective candidates, which we believe provides us with deeper insights, shortened product development cycles, reduced scientific risks and improved probability of technical and regulatory success for our product candidates relative to others.",
        "start_character": 78332,
        "end_character": 78790
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also eligible to receive up to an aggregate of $1.13 billion in development, regulatory and sales-based milestones related to products directed to targets we nominate.",
        "start_character": 15047,
        "end_character": 15221
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our capsid engineering efforts will be critical in supporting the successful clinical development of future product candidates and enabling those product candidates, if approved, to reach more patients.",
        "start_character": 84378,
        "end_character": 84591
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our innovations can support successful clinical development in part by improving the efficacy and safety profile of our product candidates.",
        "start_character": 85072,
        "end_character": 85222
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We fully integrated and internalized AAV manufacturing capabilities to support product candidates emerging from our discovery efforts that utilize AAV for delivery.",
        "start_character": 100059,
        "end_character": 100223
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We may develop one or more of our biologic product candidates in combination with a novel delivery medical device.",
        "start_character": 145568,
        "end_character": 145682
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-102252",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-102252-8f2b161244e09289",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-102252",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We rely on a combination of internal manufacturing capabilities and external CDMOs for the manufacture of the drug substance and/or drug product of our portfolio programs and intend to continue to utilize this strategy as our programs progress through various stages of clinical development and future commercialization, if approved.",
